&_nc_ohc=BZXgOC0cMJ4Q7kNvwHxKUMs&_nc_oc=AdkUzBjBwG_6kgPgHkh3N17Uluv1nBbBpCDyO1Z8bR8u8S8hQKdnCqsRjxs4TL4lynI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AftijZNIMX8tA_Z3ey8eTi-jbZJCoUmAW94Ig8mrYgvOzQ&oe=69A8193F"}, "display_name": "SWORD BISTRO VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "**Ingredients Fly Through the Air, and AI Cooks Them!?**\n\nAll the player has to do is slice the ingredients with a sword. \n\nIt's a super easy rhythm action game!\n\n\n**Slice Ingredients Simultaneously! Freshness Up, Meow!**\n\nIf you slice three ingredients simultaneously with perfect timing, the quality of the dish will improve.\n\n\n**Create One-of-a-Kind Dishes!**\n\nThe final dish varies each time based on the sliced ingredients, making it addictive. An image-generating AI using ChatGPT creates unique dishes.\n\n\n**Share Your Finished Dishes on Social Media!**\n\nIs the completed dish delicious-looking? Or perhaps a bit unusual and mysterious? \n\nPost it on social media and have fun with your friends and followers!\n\n**Would you like to grab a sword and enjoy fantasy cooking with cats?**\n{1216381432717385}\n{815571697349553}\n{870447028275041}", "short_description": "Slice and Dice with Ease! Create Fantasy Dishes with AI.\nSimply chop ingredients to the rhythm, and AI will create fantasy dishes for you."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "12.png", "id": "1720013845495589", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974506_1720013848828922_4513314424170558485_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-LYZy7RyS5oQ7kNvwGZPgPC&_nc_oc=AdlNQKdwr6ao1vMxDuccZ4NNxtRxSfzPZZkK5T7-lyJ0i88Wpii7Uy3ExL1irf_nOSY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfuG1zgy-CAAivbThR7mc5LqV47D6H65yvK8VBXBQQ8GZQ&oe=69A820B2"}, {"file_name": "8.png", "id": "1313009380118968", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974714_131300938678